# era-bank-dbo module map

**Acceptance SSOT:** [Bank-DBO-Acceptance-System](../../../docs/acceptance/Bank-DBO-Acceptance-System.md) · [Product-Readiness](../../../docs/acceptance/Bank-DBO-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md) · edition [`docs/editions/bank-dbo.yaml`](../../../docs/editions/bank-dbo.yaml)

Port **3211**. Customer channel — not ops SSO. BFF only; balances from engine.

## Public

| Path | UI |
|------|-----|
| `/login` | Retail + corporate auth (OTP / ASAN stub) |

## Customer (authenticated)

| Path | UI |
|------|-----|
| `/dashboard` | Home, total balance |
| `/accounts` | Account cards |
| `/accounts/[id]` | Account detail |
| `/transfers` | Internal transfer |
| `/payments` | Payment order list |
| `/payments/new` | Create + sign + submit (retail) |
| `/payments/approve` | Corporate signatory queue |
| `/open-api` | Corporate Open API keys (create/revoke; raw secret once) |

## Internal (orchestrator Sync)

| Path | Notes |
|------|-------|
| `POST/GET /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` | Org UUID bind (Bearer service token); kit persist + `instrumentation` boot |
| `POST/GET /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` | Desired-state runtime config (SSO, event token, activeModules); kit persist + boot hydrate |

## BFF (`app/api`)

| Route | Engine proxy |
|-------|--------------|
| `GET /api/health` | Local |
| `POST /api/auth/otp/request` | `POST /api/v1/dbo/auth/otp/request` |
| `POST /api/auth/otp/verify` | `POST /api/v1/dbo/auth/otp/verify` |
| `POST /api/auth/asan/challenge` | Channel stub + optional engine |
| `POST /api/auth/asan/callback` | `POST /api/v1/dbo/auth/asan/callback` |
| `POST /api/auth/logout` | `POST /api/v1/dbo/auth/logout` |
| `GET /api/auth/me` | `GET /api/v1/dbo/auth/me` |
| `GET /api/accounts` | `GET /api/v1/dbo/accounts` |
| `GET /api/accounts/[id]` | `GET /api/v1/dbo/accounts/:id` |
| `GET /api/accounts/[id]/statement` | `GET /api/v1/dbo/accounts/:id/statement` |
| `POST /api/transfers/internal` | `POST /api/v1/dbo/transfers/internal` |
| `GET/POST /api/payments/orders` | `/api/v1/dbo/payments/orders` |
| `GET /api/payments/orders/[id]` | `/api/v1/dbo/payments/orders/:id` |
| `POST /api/payments/orders/[id]/sign` | `/api/v1/dbo/payments/orders/:id/sign` |
| `POST /api/payments/orders/[id]/submit` | `/api/v1/dbo/payments/orders/:id/submit` |
| `POST /api/payments/orders/[id]/preflight` | `/api/v1/dbo/payments/orders/:id/preflight` (optional) |
| `GET /api/payments/sign-requests` | Channel DB |
| `GET/POST /api/open-api-keys` | Channel `CorporateApiKey` + engine `POST /dbo/open/keys/register` |
| `POST /api/open-api-keys/[id]/revoke` | Channel revoke + engine revoke |

## Channel DB models

`CustomerSession`, `CorporateApiKey`, `PaymentSignRequest` only.


## UI waves (customer)

| Path | BFF | Engine |
|------|-----|--------|
| `/standing-orders` | `/api/standing-orders` | `dbo/standing-orders` |
| `/loans/apply` | `/api/loans/applications` | `dbo/loans/applications` |
| `/cards/3ds` | `/api/cards/3ds/challenges` | `dbo/cards/3ds/challenges` |
| `/islamic` | `/api/islamic/contracts` | `dbo/islamic/contracts` (read-only) |
